<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <title>Email Template</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style='
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #17181c;
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
        "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif;
    '
  >
    <!-- Outer wrapper -->
    <table
      role="presentation"
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      border="0"
      style="background-color: #17181c"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 16px">
          <!-- Email column (600px) -->
          <table
            role="presentation"
            width="600"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            border="0"
            style="
              max-width: 600px;
              width: 100%;
              background-color: #23262f;
              border-radius: 8px;
              overflow: hidden;
            "
          >
            <!-- Header / Logo -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="background-color: #17181c; padding: 28px 40px"
              >
                <img
                  src="https://brawlhalla-api-documentation.bluemammoth.workers.dev/_astro/Logo_BrawlhallaHammer.DPwrKKOJ_ZjCW0g.webp"
                  alt="Brawlhalla"
                  width="120"
                  style="display: block; border: 0; height: auto"
                />
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Hero section -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="background-color: #17264f; padding: 48px 40px 40px"
              >
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 16px;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    line-height: 1.3;
                  "
                >
                  Introducing the Brawlhalla API
                </h1>
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                    color: #c1c3c8;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.75;
                  "
                >
                  Welcome to Version 1.0
                </p>
                <!-- CTA button -->
                <a
                  href="https://dev.brawlhalla.com"
                  style="
                    display: inline-block;
                    background-color: #3369ff;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    text-decoration: none;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                    padding: 14px 36px;
                    border-radius: 6px;
                  "
                >
                  Get Started
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body copy -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 40px 16px">
                <h2
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 12px;
                    color: #edeef3;
                    font-size: 20px;
                    font-weight: bold;
                  "
                >
                  What's this all about?
                </h2>
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #c1c3c8;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.75;
                  "
                >
                  Today, we're releasing the first upgrade for the Brawlhalla
                  API since 2023. Developers now have access to a plethora of
                  data never seen before. Additionally, our API will no longer
                  require API keys. Instead, we are using an IP-based
                  rate-limiting system.
                  <br /><br />
                  Corresponding with this new release, we have begun the deprecation
                  process for Version 0.0. New API keys will no longer be issued,
                  and Version 0.0 will reach end-of-life at the <strong
                    ><em>end of 2028</em></strong
                  >. <br /><br />
                  If you have any suggestions, feature requests, or bug reports -&nbsp;
                  <a href="mailto:noreply@noreply.com" style="color: #b3c7ff"
                    >contact us.</a
                  >&nbsp;
                  Maintaining this API is a collaborative effort. <br /><br />
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Divider -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 40px">
                <hr
                  style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #353841; margin: 0"
                />
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  background-color: #17181c;
                  padding: 28px 40px;
                  border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
                "
              >
                <!-- Footer nav links -->
                <p style="margin: 0 0 12px">
                  <a
                    href="https://legal.ubi.com/privacypolicy/"
                    style="
                      color: #b3c7ff;
                      font-size: 12px;
                      text-decoration: none;
                      margin: 0 10px;
                    "
                    >Privacy policy</a
                  >
                  <a
                    href="https://example.com"
                    style="
                      color: #b3c7ff;
                      font-size: 12px;
                      text-decoration: none;
                      margin: 0 10px;
                    "
                    >View in browser</a
                  >
                  <a
                    href="/projects/brawlhalla-api"
                    style="
                      color: #b3c7ff;
                      font-size: 12px;
                      text-decoration: none;
                      margin: 0 10px;
                    "
                    >Return to portfolio</a
                  >
                </p>
                <!-- Company info -->
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 8px;
                    color: #888c96;
                    font-size: 11px;
                    line-height: 1.75;
                  "
                >
                  © 2026 Blue Mammoth Games. All Rights Reserved.<br />
                  You're getting this email because you received an API key for Version
                  0.0.
                </p>
                <!-- Unsubscribe -->
                <a
                  href="https://example.com/unsubscribe"
                  style="
                    color: #888c96;
                    font-size: 11px;
                    text-decoration: underline;
                  "
                >
                  Unsubscribe
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <!-- /Email column -->
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <!-- /Outer wrapper -->
  </body>
</html>
